<TODOLIST FILEFORMAT="8" PROJECTNAME="" NEXTUNIQUEID="21" EARLIESTDUEDATE="0.00000000" FILEVERSION="11" LASTMODIFIED="2007-11-12"><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="57630" STARTDATESTRING="01.10.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="02.10.2007 (19:55:11)" TEXTWEBCOLOR="#808080" PRIORITY="5" CALCPERCENTDONE="100" LASTMOD="39357.82998843" TEXTCOLOR="8421504" CREATIONDATESTRING="01.10.2007" TITLE="Search Behavior Incorrect" CREATIONDATE="39356.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="1. Search and replace text by pressing ( Ctrl+H ) then close the dialog so there is a history in the auto complete drop down(s).

2. Close Search and Replace dialog.

3. Search for a word using ( Ctrl+F ).

4. Press the enter key, this will replace text same as ( Ctrl+H ) instead of searching for next string." PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#1EE100" ID="1" PERCENTDONE="100" STARTDATE="39356.00000000" DONEDATESTRING="02.10.2007" DONEDATE="39357.00000000" POS="1"/><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="04.11.2007 (10:26:52)" PRIORITY="5" CALCPERCENTDONE="100" LASTMOD="39390.43532407" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Find Dialog" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" ID="2" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" POS="2"><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="57630" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="10.11.2007 (10:12:32)" TEXTWEBCOLOR="#808080" PRIORITY="5" CALCPERCENTDONE="100" LASTMOD="39396.42537037" TEXTCOLOR="8421504" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Task" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="In &quot;Find &amp; Replace&quot; dialog, when tabbing from &quot;FindText&quot; field, the 'Replace With' combo box should get highlighted next in tab order. Currently, the &quot;Find Next&quot; button is highlighted then &quot;Replace With&quot; combo." PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#1EE100" ID="7" PERCENTDONE="100" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" DONEDATESTRING="10.11.2007" DONEDATE="39396.00000000" POS="1"/><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="57630" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="10.11.2007 (9:06:42)" TEXTWEBCOLOR="#808080" PRIORITY="5" CALCPERCENTDONE="100" LASTMOD="39396.37965278" TEXTCOLOR="8421504" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Task" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="When searching (press Ctrl+F) hitting Enter will replace text same as (Ctrl+H) instead of searching for next string." PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#1EE100" ID="8" PERCENTDONE="100" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" DONEDATESTRING="10.11.2007" DONEDATE="39396.00000000" POS="2"/><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="57630" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="10.11.2007 (9:06:46)" TEXTWEBCOLOR="#808080" PRIORITY="5" CALCPERCENTDONE="100" LASTMOD="39396.37969907" TEXTCOLOR="8421504" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Task" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="Cannot search a string and replace it with an empty string." PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#1EE100" ID="13" PERCENTDONE="100" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" DONEDATESTRING="10.11.2007" DONEDATE="39396.00000000" POS="3"/></TASK><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="04.11.2007 (10:27:56)" PRIORITY="5" LASTMOD="39390.43606481" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Font Settings" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" ID="3" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" POS="3"><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="04.11.2007 (10:28:30)" PRIORITY="5" LASTMOD="39390.43645833" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Task" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="Change font from 'Courier New' 10 pt to 'Courier New' 8 pt. This changes the font for the active document, but does not set the font for all open documents, or for documents opened after with different extensions.

Additionally, the font settings are not saved and are reset each time you run the editor." PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" ID="9" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" POS="1"/></TASK><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="04.11.2007 (10:28:14)" PRIORITY="5" CALCPERCENTDONE="100" LASTMOD="39390.43627315" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Virtual Space" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" ID="4" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" POS="4"><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="57630" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="10.11.2007 (9:35:27)" TEXTWEBCOLOR="#808080" PRIORITY="5" CALCPERCENTDONE="100" LASTMOD="39396.39961806" TEXTCOLOR="8421504" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Task" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="I noticed you added a new feature 'Virtual Space' where the selection highlights the entire line instead of the ending white space.

This is a nice feature and I can see where it would be useful, however, I think in the editor sample, this should be turned off by default, otherwise it appears to be a defect." PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#1EE100" ID="10" PERCENTDONE="100" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" DONEDATESTRING="10.11.2007" DONEDATE="39396.00000000" POS="1"/></TASK><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="04.11.2007 (10:29:01)" PRIORITY="5" CALCPERCENTDONE="50" LASTMOD="39390.43681713" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Column Block" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" ID="5" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" POS="5"><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="57630" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="12.11.2007 (20:43:32)" TEXTWEBCOLOR="#808080" PRIORITY="5" CALCPERCENTDONE="100" LASTMOD="39398.86356481" TEXTCOLOR="8421504" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Task" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="Column selection does not work when ALT+CLICK then move mouse left, it only works when moving mouse right." PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#1EE100" ID="11" PERCENTDONE="100" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" DONEDATESTRING="12.11.2007" DONEDATE="39398.00000000" POS="1"/><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" WEBCOLOR="#FF0000" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="12.11.2007 (20:44:03)" TEXTWEBCOLOR="#FF0000" PRIORITY="5" LASTMOD="39398.86392361" TEXTCOLOR="255" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Task" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="CANNOT REPEAT.
Stranged behavor, after attempting Column Block, clicking your mouse on a column other than Col 0, pressing the tab key, the cursor jumps over text instead of indenting the text." PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" ID="12" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" COLOR="255" POS="2"/></TASK><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="04.11.2007 (10:32:04)" PRIORITY="5" LASTMOD="39390.43893519" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Cut-n-Paste" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" ID="6" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" POS="6"><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" WEBCOLOR="#FF0000" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="12.11.2007 (20:44:38)" TEXTWEBCOLOR="#FF0000" PRIORITY="5" LASTMOD="39398.86432870" TEXTCOLOR="255" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Task" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="CANNOT REPEAT.
When pasting a block of text, the text is inserted before the cursor and the cursor is pushed to end of the line, and a block of whitespace is added to the end.

This is incorrect behavior, the text should be pasted after the cursor, not before." PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" ID="14" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" COLOR="255" POS="1"/></TASK><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="04.11.2007 (10:34:52)" PRIORITY="5" CALCPERCENTDONE="50" LASTMOD="39390.44087963" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Text Selection" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" ID="16" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" POS="7"><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="57630" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="12.11.2007 (20:44:48)" TEXTWEBCOLOR="#808080" PRIORITY="5" CALCPERCENTDONE="100" LASTMOD="39398.86444444" TEXTCOLOR="8421504" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Task" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="When selecting text and the pressing the left arrow key, the cursor should be placed at the beginning of the selection, instead it is placed at the character before the selection." PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#1EE100" ID="17" PERCENTDONE="100" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" DONEDATESTRING="12.11.2007" DONEDATE="39398.00000000" POS="1"/><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" STARTDATESTRING="12.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="12.11.2007 (10:06:29)" PRIORITY="5" LASTMOD="39398.42116898" CREATIONDATESTRING="12.11.2007" TITLE="Task" CREATIONDATE="39398.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="If you use the mouse to select a line and a shorter line above it you can see the highlighting flashes at the end of the line (video attached)" PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" FILEREFPATH="https://support.codejock.com/Attachments/selection%2Eavi" ID="20" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39398.00000000" POS="2"/></TASK><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="2" LASTMODSTRING="04.11.2007 (21:18:25)" PRIORITY="5" LASTMOD="39390.88778935" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Performance" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" ID="18" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" POS="8"><TASK PRIORITYCOLOR="15732480" STARTDATESTRING="04.11.2007" RISK="0" LASTMODSTRING="04.11.2007 (21:18:42)" PRIORITY="5" LASTMOD="39390.88798611" CREATIONDATESTRING="04.11.2007" TITLE="Task" CREATIONDATE="39390.00000000" COMMENTSTYPE="PLAIN_TEXT" COMMENTS="I havent examined the code for parsing and displaying text to the screen, however I think this needs some rework obviously from user complaints.

REWORK:

I would suggest that the editor maintains syntax coloring and rendering information only for the text that visible to the user, this should make parsing almost instant.

When text is not visible, it should never be parsed or colorized. Colorizing an entire document both offscreen and on screen is a huge waste of resources and not necessary." PRIORITYWEBCOLOR="#000FF0" ID="19" PERCENTDONE="0" STARTDATE="39390.00000000" POS="1"/></TASK></TODOLIST>
